# Hunter targets an opponent's creature after it attacks; the next untap is skipped and the following untap succeeds (CR 611.2a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Elvish Hunter
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Hunter.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Hunter.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Hunter.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
